<div class="content-block">
  <div class="section-head">Meeting Summary</div>
  <div class="summary-intro">
    The November 2023 meeting centered on the district's long-awaited Facilities Master Plan, presented by consultant firm Harriman Architects. The board reviewed condition assessments across all seven buildings, with Skillin Elementary identified as the most urgent renovation priority. A $42M capital improvement program was outlined over a 10-year horizon, with climate and ventilation upgrades comprising the largest single cost category. The board also approved three items on the consent agenda and received a data privacy policy update.
  </div>
</div>

